{"id":"4c508de82eee13d8","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-degree-interval-nonduality.md","title":"Degree Intervals Need Not Be Isomorphic and Are Never Dual","display":"thm-degree-interval-nonduality — Degree Intervals Need Not Be Isomorphic and Are Never Dual","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-degree-interval-nonduality","aliases":["67-thm-degree-interval-nonduality"],"display":"thm-degree-interval-nonduality — Degree Intervals Need Not Be Isomorphic and Are Never Dual","depends_on":["[[67-df-degree-structure]]","[[67-df-degree-reduction-principle]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_chapter":"7","source_section":"§1","source_label":"Theorem 7.7(a),(b)","source_printed_pages":[100,101,102],"source_pdf_pages":[111,112,113],"verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"book-proof-read; Lemmas 7.11-7.12 and earlier conservativity dependencies not independently audited","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-degree-interval-nonduality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-degree-interval-nonduality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-degree-interval-nonduality — Degree Intervals Need Not Be Isomorphic and Are Never Dual"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"026bcae68c39ac6f\" href=\"?note=026bcae68c39ac6f\" title=\"67-df-degree-reduction-principle\">67-df-degree-reduction-principle</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 7.7(a),(b)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>100</span><span>101</span><span>102</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>111</span><span>112</span><span>113</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"book-proof-read; Lemmas 7.11-7.12 and earlier conservativity dependencies not independently audited"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,D_T,\\leq_T,&lt;_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T\">\\(T,D_T,\\leq_T,&lt;_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 是集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,S\">\\(R,S\\)</span> 为二元关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\xrightarrow{\\sim}Y\">\\(f:X\\xrightarrow{\\sim}Y\\)</span> 表示双射。</li>\n<li>闭区间载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_T(a,b)\">\\(I_T(a,b)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"026bcae68c39ac6f\" href=\"?note=026bcae68c39ac6f\" title=\"67-df-degree-reduction-principle\">67-df-degree-reduction-principle</a> 的同一构造，适用范围为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in D_T\">\\(a,b\\in D_T\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\leq_Tb\">\\(a\\leq_Tb\\)</span>；关系逆 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T^{-1}=\\{(y,x):(x,y)\\in\\leq_T\\}\">\\(\\leq_T^{-1}=\\{(y,x):(x,y)\\in\\leq_T\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}\\)</span> 是四元谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}(X,R;Y,S)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\exists f:X\\xrightarrow{\\sim}Y\\;\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;\\bigl((x,x&#39;)\\in R\\leftrightarrow(f(x),f(x&#39;))\\in S\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Iso}(X,R;Y,S)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\exists f:X\\xrightarrow{\\sim}Y\\;\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;\\bigl((x,x&#39;)\\in R\\leftrightarrow(f(x),f(x&#39;))\\in S\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists a,b\\in D_T\\;\\left(\\mathbf0_T&lt;_Ta&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\land\\mathbf0_T&lt;_Tb&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Iso}(I_T(\\mathbf0_T,a),\\leq_T;I_T(\\mathbf0_T,b),\\leq_T)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists a,b\\in D_T\\;\\left(\\mathbf0_T&lt;_Ta&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\land\\mathbf0_T&lt;_Tb&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Iso}(I_T(\\mathbf0_T,a),\\leq_T;I_T(\\mathbf0_T,b),\\leq_T)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a,b,c,d\\in D_T\\;\\left((a&lt;_Tb\\land c&lt;_Td)\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Iso}(I_T(a,b),\\leq_T;I_T(c,d),\\leq_T^{-1})\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a,b,c,d\\in D_T\\;\\left((a&lt;_Tb\\land c&lt;_Td)\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Iso}(I_T(a,b),\\leq_T;I_T(c,d),\\leq_T^{-1})\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书第7章定理7(a)、(b)（印刷100–102页，PDF111–113页）。第二式比较通常序区间与另一区间的反序，不是声称所有两个通常序区间都不相同；两个区间的载体分别由闭区间式明确构造。</p>\n<p>已阅读引理11–12及定理7(b)的证明：一类区间满足约化原理，而另一类不满足；任意非平凡通常序区间含有满足约化原理的初始子区间，反序侧不具备相应对偶性质。原书说明这是通过格语言的句子区分区间；本次没有独立补全前章部分保守性构造和全部引理，故仅记录来源陈述核对及证明阅读。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-reduction-principle","status":"resolved","id":"026bcae68c39ac6f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-reduction-principle]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\leq_T,<_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-structure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-reduction-principle","status":"resolved","id":"026bcae68c39ac6f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"闭区间载体 $I_T(a,b)$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-reduction-principle]] 的同一构造，适用范围为 $a,b\\in D_T$ 且 $a\\leq_Tb$；关系逆 $\\leq_T^{-1}=\\{(y,x):(x,y)\\in\\leq_T\\}$；$\\mathrm{Iso}$ 是四元谓词。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,D_T,\\leq_T,<_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"R,S","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\xrightarrow{\\sim}Y","display":false},{"tex":"I_T(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in D_T","display":false},{"tex":"a\\leq_Tb","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_T^{-1}=\\{(y,x):(x,y)\\in\\leq_T\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}(X,R;Y,S)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\exists f:X\\xrightarrow{\\sim}Y\\;\\forall x,x'\\in X\\;\\bigl((x,x')\\in R\\leftrightarrow(f(x),f(x'))\\in S\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists a,b\\in D_T\\;\\left(\\mathbf0_T<_Ta<_T\\mathbf1_T\\land\\mathbf0_T<_Tb<_T\\mathbf1_T\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Iso}(I_T(\\mathbf0_T,a),\\leq_T;I_T(\\mathbf0_T,b),\\leq_T)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall a,b,c,d\\in D_T\\;\\left((a<_Tb\\land c<_Td)\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Iso}(I_T(a,b),\\leq_T;I_T(c,d),\\leq_T^{-1})\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":2495,"backlinks":[{"id":"026bcae68c39ac6f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本簇已存在 [[67-thm-degree-interval-nonduality]] 的同名局部闭区间记号，其集合构造完全一致，本节点将其作为可复用定义固定下来；不另造不同语义的区间。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-degree-interval-nonduality]]"}],"outgoing":["f5b9611e728efd8b","026bcae68c39ac6f"]}